    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #261\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed the fix commit to the existing branch: `bb/relay-103-inbox-pipeline-03-07-dispatch-deduplic-thr_bj2aaphg93` (already backing PR #261).\n\n## Summary\n\nThis push addresses the code-review findings from CI on PR #261:\n\n- **High severity fix**: `inboxTickAction.ts`'s `semprec.tick` handler now validates `action_config` through a zod schema (`inboxDatabaseId: z.string().uuid()`) instead of an unchecked type cast. A misconfigured or absent `inboxDatabaseId` now throws, which surfaces as a recorded heartbeat failure + notification via the existing retry/error path, instead of silently doing nothing.\n- **Medium severity fix**: `packages/data/src/index.ts` now re-exports `./inbox/inboxTickAction.js`, so `createSemprecTickAction`, `SEMPREC_TICK_ACTION_ID`, and `SEMPREC_TICK_QUEUE_NAME` are available to a service composition root that needs to register the handler this PR's seed wires a heartbeat to.\n- Added a test confirming the handler rejects an invalid/missing config instead of no-op'ing.\n\nFull test suite re-verified against this exact commit: 18 test files / 248 tests, all passing (exit code 0).\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
